160	unwritable real target directory rejects it. A link whose target does not
161	exist, or a loop of links, is rejected — the target is never created and
162	the link is never replaced. An
163	existing file that is empty, cannot be read in this format, or contains
164	several records with the same batch number is rejected outright and never
165	overwritten. "This format"
