167	batches (an array, empty allowed), each record exactly the four lowercase
168	fields batch, product, quantity and unit; missing, null, mistyped, unknown
169	or case-variant fields (Version, Batch, ...) are rejected, and so is any
170	field appearing twice in one object — even with identical values, even when
171	one spelling hides behind a JSON escape. The error names the file, the
172	field and the reason, plus the 1-based record position (and the batch id
173	when it is unambiguous) for record-level problems. Failures print
174	the reason to stderr and exit non-zero without touching the registry.
175	`
